 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. PDATES.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
*    DATES - data (PROCS/DATES.SNP; the notes are there)
 77  DT-YEAR      PIC 9(4).
 77  DT-MONTH     PIC 99.
 77  DT-DAY       PIC 99.
 77  DT-SERIAL    PIC 9(7).
 77  DT-DAYS      PIC S9(7).
 77  DT-DOW       PIC 9.
 77  DT-DOW-NAME  PIC X(9).
 77  DT-OK        PIC X.
 77  DT-LEAP      PIC X.
 77  DT-W1        PIC 9(7).
 77  DT-W2        PIC 9(7).
 77  DT-W3        PIC 9(7).
 77  SER1         PIC 9(7).
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
 MAIN-PARA.
     MOVE 2026 TO DT-YEAR. MOVE 11 TO DT-MONTH. MOVE 11 TO DT-DAY.
     PERFORM DT-WEEKDAY.
     DISPLAY "D1 0046276 3 WEDNESDAY " DT-SERIAL " " DT-DOW " "
         DT-DOW-NAME.
     PERFORM DT-CHECK. DISPLAY "D2 Y " DT-OK.
     MOVE 2024 TO DT-YEAR. MOVE 2 TO DT-MONTH. MOVE 29 TO DT-DAY.
     PERFORM DT-CHECK. DISPLAY "D3 Y " DT-OK.
     MOVE 2023 TO DT-YEAR. PERFORM DT-CHECK. DISPLAY "D4 N " DT-OK.
     MOVE 1900 TO DT-YEAR. PERFORM DT-CHECK. DISPLAY "D5 N " DT-OK.
     MOVE 2000 TO DT-YEAR. PERFORM DT-CHECK. DISPLAY "D6 Y " DT-OK.
     MOVE 4 TO DT-MONTH. MOVE 31 TO DT-DAY.
     PERFORM DT-CHECK. DISPLAY "D7 N " DT-OK.
     MOVE 2024 TO DT-YEAR. MOVE 2 TO DT-MONTH. MOVE 28 TO DT-DAY.
     MOVE 2 TO DT-DAYS. PERFORM DT-ADD-DAYS.
     DISPLAY "D8 2024 03 01 " DT-YEAR " " DT-MONTH " " DT-DAY.
     MOVE 2026 TO DT-YEAR. MOVE 12 TO DT-MONTH. MOVE 31 TO DT-DAY.
     MOVE 1 TO DT-DAYS. PERFORM DT-ADD-DAYS.
     DISPLAY "D9 2027 01 01 " DT-YEAR " " DT-MONTH " " DT-DAY.
     MOVE -366 TO DT-DAYS. PERFORM DT-ADD-DAYS.
     DISPLAY "DA 2025 12 31 " DT-YEAR " " DT-MONTH " " DT-DAY.
     MOVE 2000 TO DT-YEAR. MOVE 1 TO DT-MONTH. MOVE 1 TO DT-DAY.
     PERFORM DT-TO-SERIAL. MOVE DT-SERIAL TO SER1.
     MOVE 2026 TO DT-YEAR. MOVE 11 TO DT-MONTH. MOVE 11 TO DT-DAY.
     PERFORM DT-TO-SERIAL. SUBTRACT SER1 FROM DT-SERIAL.
     DISPLAY "DB 0009811 " DT-SERIAL.
     MOVE 1900 TO DT-YEAR. MOVE 3 TO DT-MONTH. MOVE 1 TO DT-DAY.
     PERFORM DT-WEEKDAY.
     DISPLAY "DC 0000000 THURSDAY " DT-SERIAL " " DT-DOW-NAME.
     MOVE 1969 TO DT-YEAR. MOVE 7 TO DT-MONTH. MOVE 20 TO DT-DAY.
     PERFORM DT-WEEKDAY. DISPLAY "DD SUNDAY " DT-DOW-NAME.
     PERFORM DT-TODAY.
     DISPLAY "DE TODAY " DT-YEAR " " DT-MONTH " " DT-DAY.
     STOP RUN.
*    DATES - the paragraphs
 DT-CHECK.
     MOVE "N" TO DT-OK.
     IF DT-MONTH > 0 AND DT-MONTH < 13 AND DT-DAY > 0
         MOVE 31 TO DT-W1
         IF DT-MONTH = 4 OR 6 OR 9 OR 11
             MOVE 30 TO DT-W1
         END-IF
         IF DT-MONTH = 2
             PERFORM DT-LEAP-YR
             MOVE 28 TO DT-W1
             IF DT-LEAP = "Y"
                 ADD 1 TO DT-W1
             END-IF
         END-IF
         IF DT-DAY NOT > DT-W1
             MOVE "Y" TO DT-OK
         END-IF
     END-IF.
 DT-LEAP-YR.
*    every 4th year, but not every 100th, unless 400th
     MOVE "N" TO DT-LEAP.
     DIVIDE DT-YEAR BY 4 GIVING DT-W2 REMAINDER DT-W3.
     IF DT-W3 = 0
         MOVE "Y" TO DT-LEAP
         DIVIDE DT-YEAR BY 100 GIVING DT-W2 REMAINDER DT-W3
         IF DT-W3 = 0
             MOVE "N" TO DT-LEAP
             DIVIDE DT-YEAR BY 400 GIVING DT-W2 REMAINDER DT-W3
             IF DT-W3 = 0
                 MOVE "Y" TO DT-LEAP
             END-IF
         END-IF
     END-IF.
 DT-TO-SERIAL.
*    The year is counted from March, so February - and
*    its leap day - comes last, and the months before
*    it add up to (153 * months + 2) / 5 days.  Every
*    4th year is a leap year from 1901 to 2099.
     COMPUTE DT-W1 = DT-YEAR - 1900.
     IF DT-MONTH < 3
         SUBTRACT 1 FROM DT-W1
         COMPUTE DT-W2 = DT-MONTH + 9
     ELSE
         COMPUTE DT-W2 = DT-MONTH - 3
     END-IF.
     COMPUTE DT-W3 = DT-W1 / 4.
     COMPUTE DT-SERIAL = (153 * DT-W2 + 2) / 5
         + DT-W1 * 365 + DT-W3 + DT-DAY - 1.
 DT-FROM-SER.
*    DT-TO-SERIAL backwards: the year, the day in it,
*    the month, the day in the month
     COMPUTE DT-W1 = (4 * DT-SERIAL + 3) / 1461.
     COMPUTE DT-W3 = DT-W1 / 4.
     COMPUTE DT-W2 = DT-SERIAL - DT-W1 * 365 - DT-W3.
     COMPUTE DT-YEAR = DT-W1 + 1900.
     COMPUTE DT-W3 = (5 * DT-W2 + 2) / 153.
     COMPUTE DT-W1 = (153 * DT-W3 + 2) / 5.
     COMPUTE DT-DAY = DT-W2 - DT-W1 + 1.
     IF DT-W3 < 10
         COMPUTE DT-MONTH = DT-W3 + 3
     ELSE
         COMPUTE DT-MONTH = DT-W3 - 9
         ADD 1 TO DT-YEAR
     END-IF.
 DT-WEEKDAY.
*    1 March 1900, day 0, was a Thursday (4)
     PERFORM DT-TO-SERIAL.
     COMPUTE DT-W1 = DT-SERIAL + 3.
     DIVIDE DT-W1 BY 7 GIVING DT-W2 REMAINDER DT-DOW.
     ADD 1 TO DT-DOW.
     EVALUATE DT-DOW
         WHEN 1 MOVE "MONDAY" TO DT-DOW-NAME
         WHEN 2 MOVE "TUESDAY" TO DT-DOW-NAME
         WHEN 3 MOVE "WEDNESDAY" TO DT-DOW-NAME
         WHEN 4 MOVE "THURSDAY" TO DT-DOW-NAME
         WHEN 5 MOVE "FRIDAY" TO DT-DOW-NAME
         WHEN 6 MOVE "SATURDAY" TO DT-DOW-NAME
         WHEN 7 MOVE "SUNDAY" TO DT-DOW-NAME
     END-EVALUATE.
 DT-ADD-DAYS.
     PERFORM DT-TO-SERIAL.
     ADD DT-DAYS TO DT-SERIAL.
     PERFORM DT-FROM-SER.
 DT-TODAY.
*    the clock gives YYMMDD; the century is taken as 20
     ACCEPT DT-SERIAL FROM DATE.
     DIVIDE DT-SERIAL BY 10000 GIVING DT-YEAR REMAINDER DT-W1.
     ADD 2000 TO DT-YEAR.
     DIVIDE DT-W1 BY 100 GIVING DT-MONTH REMAINDER DT-DAY.
     PERFORM DT-TO-SERIAL.
